{"id": "EUVD-2026-98938", "enisaUuid": "00ee0ccc-3639-3542-a325-6fabb2675000", "description": "B3log Symphony through 3.6.4 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to reach admin routes because PermissionMidware.check permits routes lacking permission.rule.url entries. Attackers can request /admin/report/ignore/{reportId}, /admin/tags/remove-unused, or /admin/user/{userId}/init-point to ignore reports, delete unused tags, or grant points without audit logging.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:07", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:53:07", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/b3log-symphony-admin-endpoints-missing-authorization", "https://github.com/88250/symphony/blob/827a7dd8b74316aa62f370f893a8382a8b45ba0f/src/main/java/org/b3log/symphony/processor/middleware/PermissionMidware.java#L94-L97", "https://github.com/88250/symphony/blob/827a7dd8b74316aa62f370f893a8382a8b45ba0f/src/main/java/org/b3log/symphony/processor/AdminProcessor.java#L316-L386", "https://github.com/88250/symphony", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/b3log-symphony-through-3.6.4-missing-authorization-in-admin-console-routes"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110105", "GHSA-8g6g-5xv6-gw9w"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7bb4cc62-10c4-35c5-9895-b1197218fe37", "product": {"name": "Symphony", "vendor": {"name": "Senstar"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.6.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f12c7cda-8c7a-31f3-946a-d3f9690ce119", "vendor": {"name": "b3log"}}], "isExploited": false}